  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1204883?logo=curseforge&logoColor=black&label=&labelColor=orange&color=242424\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/mutants-and-zombies?style=flat&logo=modrinth&logoColor=black&label=&labelColor=18ED49&color=242424\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutants-and-zombies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1204883(4F21AC).svg\" alt=\"支持版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rSVp3nCpPx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1388544059114786907?style=flat&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=blue\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D71EVQVC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-75D5E3?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"静态徽章\"></a></p>\n<p>本模组为游戏添加了全新的变异人与僵尸生物。它是“Ryan's Zombies”模组的官方重构版本。所有模型均由玩家 “Nice_Try_Boi” 创建并提供。</p>\n<p>目前已加入以下生物：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>僵尸暴徒</strong> - 又高又壮、如同坦克般的僵尸 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:zombie_brute</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>爬行者</strong>&nbsp;- 体型较小、速度较快，具备攀爬能力&nbsp;(ID: <code>mutantszombies:crawler</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>吐射者</strong> - 会发射史莱姆球进行攻击&nbsp;(ID: <code>mutantszombies:spitter</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>脓疱僵尸</strong> - 比一般僵尸更快、更强 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:blister_zombie</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>裂头僵尸</strong> -&nbsp;比一般僵尸更快、更强 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:split_head_zombie</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>变异暴徒</strong> -&nbsp;又高又壮、如同坦克般的变异人 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:mutant_brute</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>腐烂变异人</strong> -&nbsp;比僵尸更高、更强，但行动更慢 (ID: <code>mutantszombies:rotten_mutant</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>配置</strong></h3>\n<hr>\n<p>本模组提供简单的配置文件，用于开启或关闭生物的自然生成。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Forge</span></em></span> - 配置文件按世界单独存储：<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <em>minecraft/saves/[NAME_OF_YOUR_WORLD]/serverconfig/mutantszombies-server.toml</em></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">NeoForge</span></em></span> - 配置文件按 Minecraft 安装/实例存储：<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <em>minecraft/config/mutantszombies-server.toml</em></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Fabric</span></em></span> - 配置文件按 Minecraft 安装/实例存储：<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <em>minecraft/config/mutantszombies.json5</em></li>\n</ul>",
